On 4/22/08, Pierre Abbat <phma@phma.optus.nu> wrote:
>
> Given a selbri which has {co} in it, how do I get the equivalent selbri
> without {co}? If there are more than two components, I'm not sure how {co}
> affects grouping.

The part after co modifies all the rest, so:

    broda brode brodi co brodo co brodu
    = brodu ke brodo ke broda brode brodi

